Milestone 4:
✔ Remove greedy meshing @done(26-04-28 22:27)
    70 FPS, 440 MB at 32 Chunks
    18FPS 1.3 GB at 64 Chunks
✔ Add 2d Heightmaps instead of 3d @done(26-04-29 14:05)
    9 FPS 3.2 GB at 64 Chunks
✔ Add persistent work thread pool @done(26-04-29 14:22)
    9 FPS 3.2 GB at 64 Chunks
    
☐ Bake Chunk Positions
    Modify the mesh generator to use world-space
    coordinates. This allows us to remove the uModel 
    uniform update for every chunk, significantly 
    reducing CPU-to-GPU overhead.
☐ Fast-Path Culling
    Implement a 2D "broad-phase" distance check before
    the expensive 3D frustum check.
☐ Texture Array
    Switch from an array of samplers to 
    GL_TEXTURE_2D_ARRAY to allow more efficient 
    texture indexing in the shader.
☐ Vertex Compression
    Compress the vertex format from 28 bytes to 8 
    bytes (using uint16 and uint8). This will reduce 
    memory usage by ~3.5x and improve cache locality.
☐ Greedy Meshing
    Combine adjacent faces of the same type into 
    larger quads. This can reduce the triangle count
    and vertex count by 50%–80% in typical terrain.
☐ Heightmap Cache
    Share heightmaps between adjacent chunks during
    generation to eliminate redundant noise 
    calculations.
